# Snap & Study 🎓

Snap & Study is an AI-powered tutor built with Streamlit and Google Gemini. Students can upload photos of study notes, homework, or diagrams, receive clear explanations, and send a full summary cheat-sheet straight to their email.

## Features
- **Vision & Chat AI**: Analyzes images and text using Google's `gemini-2.5-flash` model.
- **Onboarding**: Tailored experience storing user name and delivery address.
- **Action Tool**: Generates a summary cheat-sheet and emails it using Python `smtplib`.

